# Plans Prompts Index — SSOT for Prompts

RULE: Prompts live in `unified-trading-pm/plans/prompts/`. This rule is the SSOT for their locations.

WHY: Scattered prompts cause drift; a single index ensures agents and humans find the right entry point.

## Phase Prompts

| Prompt | Path |
|--------|------|
| Phase 1 | `unified-trading-pm/plans/prompts/AGENT_PROMPT_PHASE1.md` |
| Phase 2 | `unified-trading-pm/plans/prompts/AGENT_PROMPT_PHASE2.md` |
| Phase 3 | `unified-trading-pm/plans/prompts/AGENT_PROMPT_PHASE3.md` |

## Sports

| Prompt | Path |
|--------|------|
| Sports Phase 2 | `unified-trading-pm/plans/prompts/AGENT_PROMPT_SPORTS_PHASE2.md` |

> **Task Entry Points table removed 2026-08-16** (docs-reconcile finding — `plans/tasks/{cursor,claude-code}/` no
> longer exists on disk, and no replacement path is referenced anywhere in this corpus). Task dispatch today is
> AO role-based (`unified-trading-pm/agents/*.md` role charters, spawned via `POST /api/plan-health/dispatch` or the
> backlog dispatcher) rather than a manually-maintained per-tool entry-point file.

## DO

- Reference these paths when launching agents or assigning tasks
- Add new prompts to `plans/prompts/` and update this index

## NEVER

- Create prompts in service repos, codex, or workspace root
- Assume prompts live elsewhere without checking this index

